WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-01 - Architects of the Rain
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: 1984: 1883 (The Rock Opera)

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
We traded the fog of the eastern lane

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
For a quiet roof and the Maryland rain

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
The iron gates are a hundred years old

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Built from a story we never told

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Draw the heavy velvet across the glass

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Let the modern century hurry past

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Turn the brass key in the heavy door

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
It is eighteen eighty-three forevermore

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.000
We are the architects of the rain!

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Building a fortress out of the pain!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Light the gaslamps along the hall!

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Inside these walls, nobody falls!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.000
We didn't cross an ocean to start anew

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:58.000
We crossed a century to stay with you!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Copper wires and a wooden reed

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.000
A mechanical pulse is all we need

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000
To wake the ghosts in the parlor room

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:42.000
And chase away the gathering gloom

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:48.000
No strangers allowed inside the square

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Just the two of us breathing the London air

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.000
If the world outside is cold and unkind

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:32.000
We'll lock the shutters of the mind

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:38.000
Here in the gaslight, I can stand

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:45.000
With my sister's flute inside my hand!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.000
We are the architects of the rain!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:24.000
Building a fortress out of the pain!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Light the gaslamps along the hall!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Inside these walls, nobody falls!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:43.000
We didn't cross an ocean to start anew

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:52.000
We crossed a century to stay with you!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:05:18.000
Eighteen eighty-three... inside the Hollow Square...

